(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-65","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["无线电室的窗花[[exquisite|精致]]，却在风里与栏杆[[collide|碰撞]]。墙上讲能源[[fusion|聚变]]的海报和[[decimal|小数]]刻度表都不重要，我先拿盆[[scoop|舀出]]门口积水。停电可能让今天的查柜[[culminate|告终]]，也会把住客[[strand|困在岛上]]。广播员对复电没有[[expectancy|期待]]，先用应急灯[[illuminate|照亮]]撤离路。远处[[liner|大客轮]]停止靠岸，基金网络[[forum|论坛]]还显示正常运转。程雾要我们先拍广播时间，再拍那个‘正常’，真实的求助总比屏幕上泛泛的平稳更具体。","站长对旧设备表示[[contempt|轻蔑]]，说新系统只是老机器的[[clone|翻版]]，应当[[exempt|免除]]另查义务。广播员却翻出[[physiological|生理的]]观测箱收件单，正是原批次柜的所在。他的朋友[[electrician|电工]]在楼下检查，停电前说净化装置并不能[[purify|净化]]混装箱。门轴卡死，维修组已[[rig|临时搭起]]撑架，避免坏门把碎片[[eject|弹出]]。窗框[[rim|边缘]]有一处[[rip|裂口]]，雨水顺它进入。我们把寻找文件让给负责接人的人员，站长却说再拖一会就能开门，没有理解拖延本身在增加什么。","这次风雨[[outbreak|突然爆发]]使停电[[likelihood|可能性]]变大，人群在高处[[converge|会合]]。老陈没用[[optimism|乐观]]代替准备，只提醒不能做[[drastic|极端的]]临时接线。旧时代[[epoch|时期]]留下的零件已经被标成[[saleable|可销售的]]展品，转台的[[inertia|惯性]]仍让断电后的东西慢慢动。经理想保存[[extravagant|昂贵的]]展陈灯，救援组却先[[accommodate|安置]]守楼电工的家属。孩子盯着窗上的[[cathedral|大教堂]]图样，问父亲能不能看见灯。程雾说他们正把灯带进去，没有假装知道父亲什么时候会出来。","我的心里并无推理的[[synthesis|综合]]，只有那孩子的问话。广播员[[incidentally|顺便提及]]柜子移来时带着[[polar|两极的]]温度记录，却迟迟[[linger|留在]]待核栏。数周[[cumulative|累积的]]延误，使这台[[prototype|原型设备]]从实验变成物资。老陈的[[temperament|性格]]不容他坐等，但程雾让他先[[quench|压下]]冲动，听救援人员的[[assertive|坚定的]]指示。应急电台可以[[autonomous|独立自主的]]运行，屋外[[aerial|天线]]却晃得厉害。广播员把收件单递到我手里，然后回到设备旁发出撤离确认，不把自己当成案子里一张会说话的纸。","几分钟[[elapse|过去]]，门的两侧不再保持[[symmetry|对称]]，修缮组重新固定。我努力[[visualize|想象]]电工的位置，却不能[[presume|擅自推定]]一张旧图就是眼前房间。老陈给现有测量[[complement|补充]]旧线路经过，话说得很[[articulate|清晰]]，让人员从高侧[[traverse|横越]]走道。电工终于被接上平台，腿受了伤，醒着问是不是自己弄坏供电。广播员说大家先去检查身体，再把哪一段出了问题讲清楚。老陈退到门边坐下，背上全湿了。我递给他水，他握着杯子却一时没有喝。","专业人员确认无线电室安全的一角可以取柜，执勤员拍摄开柜经过。内层只剩一份领柜联，原表已由站长借转运名义送往观测支站，要求次日贴新封签。广播员出示未发出的更改单，说明他未照办，因为目的地与旧收件单不符。我们保留下来的不是一段神秘暗号，而是一个普通人有疑问后没有立刻按键的时间。雨里支站暂时无法到达，执勤员安排守住现有转运路线。程雾看我的眼神变得慢了，说电工先回来，我们就还来得及让纸回来。老陈点头，终于把那杯水喝了。"],"en":["An [[exquisite|exquisite]] window design began to [[collide|collide]] with rails in the wind. Posters of energy [[fusion|fusion]] and [[decimal|decimal]] gauges mattered less than using a basin to [[scoop|scoop]] rainwater. A blackout might [[culminate|culminate]] our cabinet search and [[strand|strand]] guests. With no [[expectancy|expectancy]] of immediate power, the broadcaster used emergency lamps to [[illuminate|illuminate]] escape. A [[liner|liner]] ceased docking while the fund's [[forum|forum]] claimed normal operation. Cheng photographed the announcement time and then that claim: actual appeals were more specific than online reassurance.","The director expressed [[contempt|contempt]] for old equipment, calling the new system a [[clone|clone]] and claiming it [[exempt|exempt]] from further checking. A [[physiological|physiological]] observation-box receipt located the cabinet. The broadcaster's [[electrician|electrician]] friend had warned that a purifier could not [[purify|purify]] mixed cargo. A jammed door required staff to [[rig|rig]] support against fragments it might [[eject|eject]]. Water entered a [[rip|rip]] at the frame's [[rim|rim]]. We yielded document retrieval to rescue, while the director kept proposing delay without understanding its growing cost.","The weather [[outbreak|outbreak]] increased blackout [[likelihood|likelihood]]. People began to [[converge|converge]] uphill. Chen offered preparedness, not [[optimism|optimism]], and opposed [[drastic|drastic]] temporary wiring. Parts from an earlier [[epoch|epoch]] were labelled [[saleable|saleable]] exhibits; platform [[inertia|inertia]] kept movement after power failed. The manager prioritized [[extravagant|extravagant]] display lights, while rescuers sought to [[accommodate|accommodate]] the electrician's family. A child watched a [[cathedral|cathedral]] image and asked whether Father saw light. Cheng said lamps were going inside, without promising his return time.","I had no investigative [[synthesis|synthesis]], only that question. The broadcaster [[incidentally|incidentally]] mentioned [[polar|polar]] temperature records allowed to [[linger|linger]] unchecked. [[cumulative|Cumulative]] delays turned a [[prototype|prototype]] into supplies. Chen's [[temperament|temperament]] resisted waiting, but Cheng helped [[quench|quench]] impulse and follow [[assertive|assertive]] rescue instructions. The emergency radio allowed [[autonomous|autonomous]] operation, though its [[aerial|aerial]] shook. The broadcaster handed me a receipt and returned to evacuation confirmations: he was a worker, not merely a speaking document within our case.","Minutes began to [[elapse|elapse]]. The door lost [[symmetry|symmetry]] and needed refixing. Trying to [[visualize|visualize]] the electrician's position, I could not [[presume|presume]] an old plan matched present rooms. Chen could [[complement|complement]] measurements with former cable routes in [[articulate|articulate]] instructions. Rescuers could [[traverse|traverse]] the high walkway. The injured but conscious electrician asked if he had ruined power. The broadcaster proposed examining injuries first, responsibility later. Chen sat soaked beside the door, holding water without drinking.","Officers opened the cabinet in an assessed safe corner. A receipt showed the director had moved originals to an observation outpost for new seals tomorrow. The broadcaster produced an unsent amendment: destinations conflicted, so he had refused transmission. We had preserved no mysterious code, but an ordinary person's decision to pause. Rain blocked the outpost; officers guarded remaining routes. Cheng said the electrician had returned first, leaving time for paper to return too. Chen nodded and finally drank."]});
